  "body": "Kiwi Classic - Character, Charm & Potential!\r\n\r\nTo view documents for this property, please copy link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/2TQE\r\n\r\nIgnore CV - Set on a generous freehold section, this sunny, north-facing home is brimming with opportunity for first-home buyers, renovators and those looking to create something truly their own - a blank canvas just waiting for your personal touch.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover the inviting open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces, with a wood burner at the heart of the home, bringing warmth and comfort through the cooler months. Fabulous indoor-outdoor flow leads to a wonderful outdoor area, where established trees create a peaceful, private setting in which to relax and unwind.  Practicality is another bonus, with a double garage, additional carport and plenty of storage space.\r\n\r\nWhile comfortable as it stands, you can move in and live perfectly, however the real appeal lies in its outstanding renovation potential. Whether you're looking to modernise, refresh or completely transform, here's your chance to roll up your sleeves, add your own style and unlock the possibilities. Dreaming of a swimming pool? With a little imagination, that could be another possibility worth exploring!\r\n\r\nThere's something special about a true Kiwi classic, and homes like these are becoming increasingly hard to find. A home filled with warmth, character and a sense of belonging, where everyday living feels easy, family memories are made naturally, and a fabulous street adds to the appeal.\r\n\r\nLocation is another standout. Enjoy the convenience of Long Bay Beach and local supermarkets within easy walking distance, with parks, cafés and the wonderful coastal lifestyle all close by. And let's not forget the award-winning local pie shop - sure to become a favourite!\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, searching for your next renovation project or simply wanting a home you can make your own, 13 Manuwai Road is packed with possibilities.\r\n\r\nBring Your Vision - Your Next Chapter Starts Here! Call Lisa & Olena Today!\r\n\r\nClassic. Sunny. Full of Potential.\r\n\r\nWelcome Home to Torbay.",
